  "description": "Merged 10 ibm security advisories published on 2026-10-29. Original advisory IDs: IBM-7294607, IBM-7294620, IBM-7294675, IBM-7294717, IBM-7294491, IBM-7294092, IBM-7293670, IBM-7294826, IBM-7294603, IBM-7294467\n\nTitles:\n- Multiple Vulnerabilities in IBM Concert Software\n- Vulnerability in json5-0.5.1 may affect IBM Infosphere Change Data Capture (CVE-2022-46175)\n- IBM InfoSphere Optim Archive Viewer is affected by a vulnerability in starlette (CVE-2026-48710)\n- Multiple vulnerabilities in IBM Observability with Instana (OnPrem)\n- IBM MQ is affected by a security bypass vulnerability in IBM WebSphere Application Server Liberty (CVE-2026-10842)\n- IBM QRadar SIEM contains weak private keys issued by the eMudhra certificate authority\n- IBM QRadar SIEM contains PHP components with known vulnerabilities\n- Security vulnerabilities have been found in IBM Verify Identity Access and IBM Security Verify Access\n- Security Vulnerabilities were found in IBM WebSphere Application Server and IBM WebSphere Application Server Liberty provided with IBM Verify Directory\n- Langflow OSS is affected by multiple vulnerabilities",
